INSERT INTO `topics` VALUES (10,3,NULL,'Python Programming ','Python Programming ','Python is a high-level, interpreted programming language created by Guido van Rossum and first released in 1991. Designed with a core philosophy emphasizing code readability and simplicity, it uses clean, English-like syntax and strict visual indentation rather than curly braces or semicolons. This low barrier to entry allows beginners to quickly grasp programming fundamentals without getting bogged down by boilerplate code, while enabling experienced developers to write clear, logical, and maintainable software in fewer lines.\r\n\r\nAs a multi-paradigm language, Python supports object-oriented, functional, and procedural programming styles, running seamlessly across platforms like Windows, macOS, and Linux. It operates on an automated memory management model with dynamic typing and garbage collection, freeing developers from low-level system concerns. While interpreted languages can be slower than compiled alternatives like C++ or Rust, Python bridges this gap by functioning as an exceptional \"glue language,\" capable of interfacing directly with high-performance C and C++ extensions when heavy computation is required.\r\n\r\nToday, Python powers much of modern computing thanks to its massive and active open-source ecosystem. It has become the standard language for artificial intelligence, machine learning, and data science through foundational libraries like NumPy, Pandas, PyTorch, and TensorFlow. Beyond data and AI, Python remains widely used for web development with frameworks like Django and FastAPI, system automation, cybersecurity scripting, and scientific computing, making it one of the most versatile and in-demand skills in the tech industry.',40,20,NULL,'/uploads/13f54459-354d-4757-b44d-843368c9571b.jpg','left','2026-09-14 13:32:03'),(23,3,10,'Level 1 ΓÇö Python Fundamentals','Level 1 ΓÇö Python Fundamentals','<h2 data-path-to-node=\"2\">1. Introduction to Python</h2><p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Python is a high-level, interpreted, general-purpose programming language created by Guido van Rossum and released in 1991. It emphasizes code readability, developer productivity, and expressive syntax that mirrors standard English.</p><ul data-path-to-node=\"4\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Interpreted:</b> Python executes code line-by-line via the Python Virtual Machine (PVM), eliminating the need for manual compilation steps during development.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Dynamically Typed:</b> Variable types do not need explicit declaration; the interpreter resolves types at runtime.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Multi-Paradigm:</b> Fully supports object-oriented, procedural, and functional programming styles.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"4,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Batteries Included:</b> Features an extensive standard library that handles everything from file I/O and networking to data serialization and cryptography out of the box.</p></li></ul><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c871622707-46 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"code-block ng-tns-c871622707-46 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation\" jslog=\"223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl9iMzc0OTMwMmM0YTY3M2E5IiwiY18xZThiZmY1ODM0NzBmNzAzIixudWxsLCJyY183NjEwZjgwY2E1YmEzNDFjIixudWxsLG51bGwsImVuIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDEsMF1d\" data-hveid=\"0\" decode-data-ved=\"1\" data-ved=\"0CAAQhtANahgKEwiH98ae2e6WAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQogE\"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c871622707-46\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"animated-opacity ng-tns-c871622707-46\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c871622707-46 ng-star-inserted\"><img src=\"http://localhost:5000/uploads/8c2fa702-f864-4abd-84ba-322a84ac83db.png\" alt=\"Pasted image\"></div><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h2 data-path-to-node=\"7\">2. Installing Python and Setting Up the Environment</h2><p data-path-to-node=\"8\">A reliable development workflow starts with installing the official interpreter, managing packages, and configuring an isolated environment.</p><ul data-path-to-node=\"9\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Installation:</b> Download the official release from <response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><link-block _nghost-ng-c3887769828=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><a _ngcontent-ng-c3887769828=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" externallink=\"\" _nghost-ng-c4283109139=\"\" jslog=\"197247;track:generic_click,impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl9iMzc0OTMwMmM0YTY3M2E5IiwiY18xZThiZmY1ODM0NzBmNzAzIixudWxsLCJyY183NjEwZjgwY2E1YmEzNDFjIixudWxsLG51bGwsImVuIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDEsMF1d\" href=\"https://www.python.org\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" data-hveid=\"0\" decode-data-ved=\"1\" data-ved=\"0CAAQ_4QMahgKEwiH98ae2e6WAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQowE\">python.org</a><!----></link-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element>. On Windows, check <b data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"79\">\"Add Python to PATH\"</b> during setup. On macOS/Linux, verify installation using <code data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"156\">python3 --version</code>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Package Management:</b> Python bundles <code data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"35\">pip</code>, the standard tool for installing packages from the Python Package Index (PyPI):</p><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c871622707-47 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"code-block ng-tns-c871622707-47 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation\" jslog=\"223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl9iMzc0OTMwMmM0YTY3M2E5IiwiY18xZThiZmY1ODM0NzBmNzAzIixudWxsLCJyY183NjEwZjgwY2E1YmEzNDFjIixudWxsLG51bGwsImVuIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDEsMF1d\" data-hveid=\"0\" decode-data-ved=\"1\" data-ved=\"0CAAQhtANahgKEwiH98ae2e6WAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQpAE\"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c871622707-47\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"animated-opacity ng-tns-c871622707-47\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c871622707-47 ng-star-inserted\"><img src=\"http://localhost:5000/uploads/8216b3bf-26cf-4a52-9aa5-2aff9c834530.png\" alt=\"Pasted image\"></div><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Virtual Environments (<code data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"22\">venv</code>):</b> Isolate project-specific dependencies to prevent system-level package conflicts:</p><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c871622707-48 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"code-block ng-tns-c871622707-48 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation\" jslog=\"223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl9iMzc0OTMwMmM0YTY3M2E5IiwiY18xZThiZmY1ODM0NzBmNzAzIixudWxsLCJyY183NjEwZjgwY2E1YmEzNDFjIixudWxsLG51bGwsImVuIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDEsMF1d\" data-hveid=\"0\" decode-data-ved=\"1\" data-ved=\"0CAAQhtANahgKEwiH98ae2e6WAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQpQE\"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c871622707-48\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"animated-opacity ng-tns-c871622707-48\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c871622707-48 ng-star-inserted\"><img src=\"http://localhost:5000/uploads/dee49ca2-d451-4b8e-b2a7-4dba45d94779.png\" alt=\"Pasted image\"></div><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Recommended Editor:</b> Use Visual Studio Code with the official <b data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"61\">Python extension</b> (by Microsoft) for linting, syntax highlighting, and integrated debugging.</p></li></ul><h2 data-path-to-node=\"11\">3. Variables and Data Types</h2><p data-path-to-node=\"12\">Variables in Python act as labeled references pointing to objects in memory. You assign them using the <code data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"103\">=</code> operator without specifying explicit types.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"12\"><img src=\"http://localhost:5000/uploads/b7d44723-8a7b-460c-8cbc-6bd4e6288699.png\" alt=\"Pasted image\"></p><p data-path-to-node=\"12\"><img src=\"http://localhost:5000/uploads/9fe81716-3d56-4814-ae2b-6d536ce1dfb6.png\" alt=\"Pasted image\"></p><h2 data-path-to-node=\"17\">4. Operators</h2><p data-path-to-node=\"18\">Operators perform operations on variables and values. Python categorizes them into several core groups:</p><ul data-path-to-node=\"19\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Arithmetic Operators:</b></p><ul data-path-to-node=\"19,0,1\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"19,0,1,0,0\">Addition (<code data-path-to-node=\"19,0,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"10\">+</code>), Subtraction (<code data-path-to-node=\"19,0,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"27\">-</code>), Multiplication (<code data-path-to-node=\"19,0,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"47\">*</code>), Division (<code data-path-to-node=\"19,0,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"61\">/</code> returns float)</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"19,0,1,1,0\">Floor Division (<code data-path-to-node=\"19,0,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"16\">//</code> returns integer quotient), Modulo (<code data-path-to-node=\"19,0,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"54\">%</code> returns remainder), Exponentiation (<code data-path-to-node=\"19,0,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"92\">**</code>)</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" id=\"p-rc_7610f80ca5ba341c-25\"><b data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-443 citation-end-443\">Comparison Operators:<source-footnote ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c3609044789=\"\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3609044789=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span></b><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c2756404852=\"\">  <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2756404852=\"\" _nghost-ng-c257345503=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p><div _ngcontent-ng-c257345503=\"\" class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources ng-star-inserted\"><button _ngcontent-ng-c257345503=\"\" cdkoverlayorigin=\"\" class=\"button multiple-button ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"View source details. Press Enter to open sources dialog.\"><!----><!----><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><p></p><ul data-path-to-node=\"19,1,1\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"19,1,1,0,0\" id=\"p-rc_7610f80ca5ba341c-26\"><span class=\"citation-442\">Equal (</span><code data-path-to-node=\"19,1,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"7\">==</code><span class=\"citation-442\">), Not Equal (</span><code data-path-to-node=\"19,1,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"23\">!=</code><span class=\"citation-442\">), Greater Than (</span><code data-path-to-node=\"19,1,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"42\">&gt;</code><span class=\"citation-442\">), Less Than (</span><code data-path-to-node=\"19,1,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"57\">&lt;</code><span class=\"citation-442\">), Greater or Equal (</span><code data-path-to-node=\"19,1,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"79\">&gt;=</code><span class=\"citation-442\">), Less or Equal (</span><code data-path-to-node=\"19,1,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"99\">&lt;=</code><span class=\"citation-442 citation-end-442\">)<source-footnote ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c3609044789=\"\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3609044789=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c2756404852=\"\">  <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2756404852=\"\" _nghost-ng-c257345503=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p><div _ngcontent-ng-c257345503=\"\" class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources ng-star-inserted\"><button _ngcontent-ng-c257345503=\"\" cdkoverlayorigin=\"\" class=\"button multiple-button ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"View source details. Press Enter to open sources dialog.\"><!----><!----><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><p></p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\" id=\"p-rc_7610f80ca5ba341c-27\"><b data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-441 citation-end-441\">Logical Operators:<source-footnote ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c3609044789=\"\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3609044789=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span></b><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c2756404852=\"\">  <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2756404852=\"\" _nghost-ng-c257345503=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p><div _ngcontent-ng-c257345503=\"\" class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources ng-star-inserted\"><button _ngcontent-ng-c257345503=\"\" cdkoverlayorigin=\"\" class=\"button multiple-button ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"View source details. Press Enter to open sources dialog.\"><!----><!----><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><p></p><ul data-path-to-node=\"19,2,1\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"19,2,1,0,0\" id=\"p-rc_7610f80ca5ba341c-28\"><span class=\"citation-440\"></span><code data-path-to-node=\"19,2,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">and</code><span class=\"citation-440 citation-end-440\">: True if both conditions are True<source-footnote ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c3609044789=\"\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3609044789=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c2756404852=\"\">  <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2756404852=\"\" _nghost-ng-c257345503=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p><div _ngcontent-ng-c257345503=\"\" class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources ng-star-inserted\"><button _ngcontent-ng-c257345503=\"\" cdkoverlayorigin=\"\" class=\"button multiple-button ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"View source details. Press Enter to open sources dialog.\"><!----><!----><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><p></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"19,2,1,1,0\" id=\"p-rc_7610f80ca5ba341c-29\"><span class=\"citation-439\"></span><code data-path-to-node=\"19,2,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">or</code><span class=\"citation-439 citation-end-439\">: True if at least one condition is True<source-footnote ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c3609044789=\"\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3609044789=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c2756404852=\"\">  <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2756404852=\"\" _nghost-ng-c257345503=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p><div _ngcontent-ng-c257345503=\"\" class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources ng-star-inserted\"><button _ngcontent-ng-c257345503=\"\" cdkoverlayorigin=\"\" class=\"button multiple-button ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"View source details. Press Enter to open sources dialog.\"><!----><!----><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><p></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"19,2,1,2,0\" id=\"p-rc_7610f80ca5ba341c-30\"><span class=\"citation-438\"></span><code data-path-to-node=\"19,2,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">not</code><span class=\"citation-438 citation-end-438\">: Inverts the B<source-footnote ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c3609044789=\"\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3609044789=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span>oolean value<sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c2756404852=\"\">  <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2756404852=\"\" _nghost-ng-c257345503=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p><div _ngcontent-ng-c257345503=\"\" class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources ng-star-inserted\"><button _ngcontent-ng-c257345503=\"\" cdkoverlayorigin=\"\" class=\"button multiple-button ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"View source details. Press Enter to open sources dialog.\"><!----><!----><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><p></p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"19,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"19,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Assignment Operators:</b></p><ul data-path-to-node=\"19,3,1\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"19,3,1,0,0\"><code data-path-to-node=\"19,3,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">=</code>, <code data-path-to-node=\"19,3,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"3\">+=</code>, <code data-path-to-node=\"19,3,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"7\">-=</code>, <code data-path-to-node=\"19,3,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"11\">*=</code>, <code data-path-to-node=\"19,3,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"15\">/=</code>, <code data-path-to-node=\"19,3,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"19\">//=</code>, <code data-path-to-node=\"19,3,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"24\">%=</code></p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"19,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"19,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Membership Operators:</b></p><ul data-path-to-node=\"19,4,1\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"19,4,1,0,0\"><code data-path-to-node=\"19,4,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">in</code>, <code data-path-to-node=\"19,4,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"4\">not in</code> (checks if a value exists within an iterable)</p></li></ul></li></ul><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"code-block ng-tns-c871622707-50 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation\" jslog=\"223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl9iMzc0OTMwMmM0YTY3M2E5IiwiY18xZThiZmY1ODM0NzBmNzAzIixudWxsLCJyY183NjEwZjgwY2E1YmEzNDFjIixudWxsLG51bGwsImVuIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDEsMF1d\" data-hveid=\"0\" decode-data-ved=\"1\" data-ved=\"0CAAQhtANahgKEwiH98ae2e6WAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQqQE\"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c871622707-50\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"animated-opacity ng-tns-c871622707-50\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c871622707-50 ng-star-inserted\"><img src=\"http://localhost:5000/uploads/5a0bcd9b-4e88-4c25-b3b5-e51e85f7b992.png\" alt=\"Pasted image\"></div><!----></div></div></div><h2 data-path-to-node=\"22\">5. Input and Output</h2><p data-path-to-node=\"23\">Python handles terminal interactions via <code data-path-to-node=\"23\" data-index-in-node=\"41\">print()</code> for output and <code data-path-to-node=\"23\" data-index-in-node=\"64\">input()</code> for reading user text.</p><ul data-path-to-node=\"24\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"24,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"24,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><code data-path-to-node=\"24,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">print()</code>:</b> Outputs formatted data to the standard output. Supports custom delimiters via <code data-path-to-node=\"24,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"87\">sep</code> and <code data-path-to-node=\"24,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"95\">end</code>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"24,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"24,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><code data-path-to-node=\"24,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">input()</code>:</b> Pauses execution and reads a line of input from standard input as a <code data-path-to-node=\"24,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"77\">str</code>. Explicit type casting (<code data-path-to-node=\"24,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"105\">int()</code>, <code data-path-to-node=\"24,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"112\">float()</code>) is required for numeric inputs.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"24,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"24,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Formatted Strings (f-strings):</b> Evaluate expressions and insert variables cleanly inside string literals using <code data-path-to-node=\"24,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"110\">f\"{variable}\"</code>.</p></li></ul><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"code-block ng-tns-c871622707-51 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation\" jslog=\"223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl9iMzc0OTMwMmM0YTY3M2E5IiwiY18xZThiZmY1ODM0NzBmNzAzIixudWxsLCJyY183NjEwZjgwY2E1YmEzNDFjIixudWxsLG51bGwsImVuIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDEsMF1d\" data-hveid=\"0\" decode-data-ved=\"1\" data-ved=\"0CAAQhtANahgKEwiH98ae2e6WAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQqgE\"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c871622707-51\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"animated-opacity ng-tns-c871622707-51\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c871622707-51 ng-star-inserted\"><img src=\"http://localhost:5000/uploads/c540eb5e-483e-47d6-a5a7-6b9e30668b9e.png\" alt=\"Pasted image\"></div><!----></div></div></div><h2 data-path-to-node=\"27\">6. Conditional Statements (<code data-path-to-node=\"27\" data-index-in-node=\"27\">if</code>, <code data-path-to-node=\"27\" data-index-in-node=\"31\">elif</code>, <code data-path-to-node=\"27\" data-index-in-node=\"37\">else</code>)</h2><p data-path-to-node=\"28\">Conditionals evaluate expressions and execute specific code blocks depending on whether the condition evaluates to <code data-path-to-node=\"28\" data-index-in-node=\"115\">True</code> or <code data-path-to-node=\"28\" data-index-in-node=\"123\">False</code>. Python strictly relies on four-space indentation to define these blocks.</p><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"code-block ng-tns-c871622707-52 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation\" jslog=\"223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl9iMzc0OTMwMmM0YTY3M2E5IiwiY18xZThiZmY1ODM0NzBmNzAzIixudWxsLCJyY183NjEwZjgwY2E1YmEzNDFjIixudWxsLG51bGwsImVuIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDEsMF1d\" data-hveid=\"0\" decode-data-ved=\"1\" data-ved=\"0CAAQhtANahgKEwiH98ae2e6WAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQqwE\"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c871622707-52\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"animated-opacity ng-tns-c871622707-52\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c871622707-52 ng-star-inserted\"><img src=\"http://localhost:5000/uploads/dab6897b-f540-4c4a-8bbb-5ad107a1b100.png\" alt=\"Pasted image\"></div><!----></div></div></div><ul data-path-to-node=\"30\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"30,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"30,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Short-circuiting:</b> Logical operations evaluate lazily. In <code data-path-to-node=\"30,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"57\">A and B</code>, if <code data-path-to-node=\"30,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"69\">A</code> is False, <code data-path-to-node=\"30,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"81\">B</code> is never evaluated.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"30,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"30,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Ternary Expression (One-line if-else):</b></p><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c871622707-53 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"code-block ng-tns-c871622707-53 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation\" jslog=\"223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl9iMzc0OTMwMmM0YTY3M2E5IiwiY18xZThiZmY1ODM0NzBmNzAzIixudWxsLCJyY183NjEwZjgwY2E1YmEzNDFjIixudWxsLG51bGwsImVuIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDEsMF1d\" data-hveid=\"0\" decode-data-ved=\"1\" data-ved=\"0CAAQhtANahgKEwiH98ae2e6WAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQrAE\"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c871622707-53\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"animated-opacity ng-tns-c871622707-53\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c871622707-53 ng-star-inserted\"><img src=\"http://localhost:5000/uploads/168d18a1-e0b3-44e6-ab42-413598f85baf.png\" alt=\"Pasted image\"></div><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></li></ul><h2 data-path-to-node=\"32\">7. Loops (<code data-path-to-node=\"32\" data-index-in-node=\"10\">for</code>, <code data-path-to-node=\"32\" data-index-in-node=\"15\">while</code>)</h2><p data-path-to-node=\"33\">Loops allow repetitive execution of code blocks across sequences or until specific conditions are met.</p><ul data-path-to-node=\"34\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"34,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"34,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><code data-path-to-node=\"34,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">for</code> loop:</b> Iterates directly over any iterable object (lists, strings, ranges, dictionaries).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"34,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"34,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><code data-path-to-node=\"34,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">while</code> loop:</b> Executes repeatedly as long as a target condition remains <code data-path-to-node=\"34,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"70\">True</code>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"34,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"34,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Loop Control Statements:</b></p><ul data-path-to-node=\"34,2,1\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"34,2,1,0,0\"><code data-path-to-node=\"34,2,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">break</code>: Immediately terminates the loop.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"34,2,1,1,0\"><code data-path-to-node=\"34,2,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">continue</code>: Skips the remainder of the current iteration and advances to the next.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"34,2,1,2,0\"><code data-path-to-node=\"34,2,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">else</code> clause: Executes only if the loop completes normally without hitting a <code data-path-to-node=\"34,2,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"76\">break</code>.</p></li></ul></li></ul><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"code-block ng-tns-c871622707-54 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation\" jslog=\"223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl9iMzc0OTMwMmM0YTY3M2E5IiwiY18xZThiZmY1ODM0NzBmNzAzIixudWxsLCJyY183NjEwZjgwY2E1YmEzNDFjIixudWxsLG51bGwsImVuIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDEsMF1d\" data-hveid=\"0\" decode-data-ved=\"1\" data-ved=\"0CAAQhtANahgKEwiH98ae2e6WAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQrQE\"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c871622707-54\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"animated-opacity ng-tns-c871622707-54\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c871622707-54 ng-star-inserted\"><img src=\"http://localhost:5000/uploads/0855c0f9-6a67-4172-b884-3987aa4a436d.png\" alt=\"Pasted image\"></div><!----></div></div></div><h2 data-path-to-node=\"37\">8. Basic Problem Solving</h2><p data-path-to-node=\"38\">Problem solving in Python involves breaking algorithmic tasks down into structured logic: decomposing inputs, applying standard traversal or filtering, and transforming output data.</p><h3 data-path-to-node=\"39\">Example: Finding the Maximum and Filtering Even Numbers</h3><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"code-block ng-tns-c871622707-55 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation\" jslog=\"223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl9iMzc0OTMwMmM0YTY3M2E5IiwiY18xZThiZmY1ODM0NzBmNzAzIixudWxsLCJyY183NjEwZjgwY2E1YmEzNDFjIixudWxsLG51bGwsImVuIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDEsMF1d\" data-hveid=\"0\" decode-data-ved=\"1\" data-ved=\"0CAAQhtANahgKEwiH98ae2e6WAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQrgE\"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c871622707-55\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"animated-opacity ng-tns-c871622707-55\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c871622707-55 ng-star-inserted\"><img src=\"http://localhost:5000/uploads/375ac088-37c7-4b7f-a3ad-28ec503b354a.png\" alt=\"Pasted image\"></div><!----></div></div></div><h2 data-path-to-node=\"42\">9. Functions</h2><p data-path-to-node=\"43\">Functions are reusable blocks of code that take parameters, perform an isolated routine, and optionally return a result. They are defined using the <code data-path-to-node=\"43\" data-index-in-node=\"148\">def</code> keyword.</p><ul data-path-to-node=\"44\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"44,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"44,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Parameters vs. Arguments:</b> Parameters are variable names declared in the function definition; arguments are the concrete values passed during the call.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"44,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"44,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Default Arguments:</b> Allow callers to omit parameters.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"44,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"44,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Keyword Arguments:</b> Allow arguments to be passed out-of-order by specifying the parameter name.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"44,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"44,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Scope:</b> Variables defined inside a function remain local to that function.</p></li></ul><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"code-block ng-tns-c871622707-56 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation\" jslog=\"223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl9iMzc0OTMwMmM0YTY3M2E5IiwiY18xZThiZmY1ODM0NzBmNzAzIixudWxsLCJyY183NjEwZjgwY2E1YmEzNDFjIixudWxsLG51bGwsImVuIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDEsMF1d\" data-hveid=\"0\" decode-data-ved=\"1\" data-ved=\"0CAAQhtANahgKEwiH98ae2e6WAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQrwE\"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c871622707-56\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"animated-opacity ng-tns-c871622707-56\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c871622707-56 ng-star-inserted\"><img src=\"http://localhost:5000/uploads/c1644f2f-2a47-488e-bc6a-cf72d33477f3.png\" alt=\"Pasted image\"></div><!----></div></div></div><h2 data-path-to-node=\"47\">10. Basic Error Handling</h2><p data-path-to-node=\"48\">Python uses structured exception handling to catch runtime errors gracefully instead of crashing the program.</p><ul data-path-to-node=\"49\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"49,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"49,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><code data-path-to-node=\"49,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">try</code> block:</b> Houses code that may trigger an error.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"49,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"49,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><code data-path-to-node=\"49,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">except</code> block:</b> Handles specific exceptions when they arise.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"49,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"49,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><code data-path-to-node=\"49,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">else</code> block:</b> Runs if the <code data-path-to-node=\"49,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"24\">try</code> block executes successfully without raising exceptions.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"49,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"49,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><code data-path-to-node=\"49,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">finally</code> block:</b> Runs unconditionally, typically used for cleanup (e.g., closing database connections or open files).</p></li></ul><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"code-block ng-tns-c871622707-57 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation\" jslog=\"223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl9iMzc0OTMwMmM0YTY3M2E5IiwiY18xZThiZmY1ODM0NzBmNzAzIixudWxsLCJyY183NjEwZjgwY2E1YmEzNDFjIixudWxsLG51bGwsImVuIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDEsMF1d\" data-hveid=\"0\" decode-data-ved=\"1\" data-ved=\"0CAAQhtANahgKEwiH98ae2e6WAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQsAE\"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c871622707-57\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"animated-opacity ng-tns-c871622707-57\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c871622707-57 ng-star-inserted\"><img src=\"http://localhost:5000/uploads/97f5d838-4031-4f11-93ba-2565a4129cee.png\" alt=\"Pasted image\"></div><!----></div></div></div><h2 data-path-to-node=\"52\">11. Introduction to Modules</h2><p data-path-to-node=\"53\">A module is a single Python file (<code data-path-to-node=\"53\" data-index-in-node=\"34\">.py</code>) containing definitions, statements, and functions designed for reuse across other programs.</p><ul data-path-to-node=\"54\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"54,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"54,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Importing Standard Modules:</b> Bring in standard tools via <code data-path-to-node=\"54,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"56\">import &lt;module&gt;</code> or <code data-path-to-node=\"54,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"75\">from &lt;module&gt; import &lt;target&gt;</code>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"54,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"54,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Common Standard Library Modules:</b></p><ul data-path-to-node=\"54,1,1\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"54,1,1,0,0\"><code data-path-to-node=\"54,1,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">math</code>: Advanced mathematical operations (<code data-path-to-node=\"54,1,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"40\">math.sqrt()</code>, <code data-path-to-node=\"54,1,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"53\">math.ceil()</code>).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"54,1,1,1,0\"><code data-path-to-node=\"54,1,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">random</code>: Pseudo-random number generators and sequence shuffling.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"54,1,1,2,0\"><code data-path-to-node=\"54,1,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">datetime</code>: Date and timestamp manipulation.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"54,1,1,3,0\"><code data-path-to-node=\"54,1,1,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">os</code> / <code data-path-to-node=\"54,1,1,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"5\">sys</code>: Operating system interactions and runtime parameters.</p></li></ul></li></ul><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"code-block ng-tns-c871622707-58 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation\" jslog=\"223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl9iMzc0OTMwMmM0YTY3M2E5IiwiY18xZThiZmY1ODM0NzBmNzAzIixudWxsLCJyY183NjEwZjgwY2E1YmEzNDFjIixudWxsLG51bGwsImVuIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDEsMF1d\" data-hveid=\"0\" decode-data-ved=\"1\" data-ved=\"0CAAQhtANahgKEwiH98ae2e6WAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQsQE\"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c871622707-58\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"animated-opacity ng-tns-c871622707-58\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c871622707=\"\" class=\"code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c871622707-58 ng-star-inserted\"><img src=\"http://localhost:5000/uploads/51faffb9-581c-464c-94bf-ca0d3a9f1a83.png\" alt=\"Pasted image\"></div><!----></div></div></div><p data-path-to-node=\"12\"><response-element class=\"no-md\